# C03 · Work Mac (mrtysn-mbp-m5) — machine-specific shell config. Empty until the machine needs some.

# On macOS 27 the Spotlight and Apps UI run inside the "Siri AI" process. When Cmd+Space or the Apps
# key does nothing (window created but never shown, Nov 23 2026), restarting it fixes it; launchd respawns it.
alias restart-spotlight-ui='killall "Siri AI"'
